\newlabel{fig:timeseries}{{1}{4}{Per-frame AQMH quality-map diagnostics. The shaded band shows the p10-p90 interval of the map values; mean and median remain stable across the 645-frame sequence. The artifact fraction stays near five percent, with a higher early-frame tail}{figure.1}{}}
